List all of the flags that can be passed to gn

$ ./out/Release/gn args --list out/Release

use_system_sqlite=true
enable_wayland_server=true
enable_reporting=false

build/linux/sysroot_scripts


Component build
===============

On an architecture named in COMPONENT_BUILD_ARCHS in debian/rules, the code
links into several hundred shared libraries under /usr/lib/chromium instead of
one chrome binary. A 32-bit architecture needs this, because the final link of
chrome does not fit in a 32-bit address space.

A component build requires is_official_build=false, so use_mold,
dcheck_always_on and use_thin_lto are set to false on every architecture.
